  "historyNote": "#4327, eff 10-22-87; ss by #4348, eff 12-22-87; ss by #4572, eff 2-3-89; amd by #4733, eff 1-22-90; amd by #5125, eff 4-26-91; amd by #5384, eff 4-29-92; amd by #5625, eff6-1-93; ss by #5817, eff 4-26-94; amd by #6038, eff 5-17-95; ss by #6250, eff 5-22-96 (See Revision Note at part heading for Fis 301); ss by #6520, eff 5-31-97; ss by #6783, eff 6-30-98; ss by #7699, eff 6-5-02; ss by #8085, eff 5-26-04; amd by #8357, eff 5-25-05; amd by #8931, eff 7-6-07; ss by #9163, eff 5-28-08; amd by #9720-A, eff 6-5-10, (paras (a)-(p) & (r)-(y)); amd by #9720-B, eff 6-5-10, (para (q)); amd by 9800-A, eff 1-1-11 para (k); ss by #10142, eff 6-5-12; ss by #10619, eff 6-2-14; ss by #12591, eff 7-25-18; ss by #13211, eff 5-26-21; ss by #14308, eff 7-10-25, EXPIRES: 7-10-35",
